      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's like \"We're seek- ing future investi- Gators!\"..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I wonder which is good?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "\"RuffIANS WILL RECEIVE A WARM WELCOME\" OR SOMETHING. AW, but working with them would be scary though..."
    },
    {
